  "lines": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "Der Psalter ist vollendet.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "The Psalter is finished."
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "text": "Ich überantwortete ihn dem Becker am Feste des",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I delivered it to Becker on the feast of"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "text": "heiligen Nikolaus. Er hielt ihn nicht weit von sich,",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "Saint Nicholas. He held it not at arm length,"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "text": "wie Männer Dinge halten, die sie nur zeigen wollen,",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "the way men hold objects they intend to display,"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "text": "sondern nahe, den Rücken in seiner Handfläche, und",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "but close, the spine resting in his palm, and"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "text": "schlug ihn in der Mitte auff und las schweigend",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "opened it to the middle and read in silence"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "text": "und blickte auff und sprach nichts, welches die",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "and looked up and said nothing, which was the"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "text": "rechte Antwort war. Sein achtjäriger Son stund dabey.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "right response. His eight-year-old son was there."
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "text": "Ich gedachte an Peter.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I thought about Peter."
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "text": "Ich nam Beckers Zahlung und gieng heim durch den",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I accepted Becker payment and walked home through the"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "text": "kalten Marckt, da ich meinen Atem sehen kunnte, und",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "cold market where I could see my breath, and"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "text": "gedachte: Dieses besondere Ding wird dieses",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "thought: This particular thing will outlast this"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "text": "besondere Mich überdauern.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "particular me."
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "text": "Der Brief aus Straßburg kam elff Tage darnach.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "The letter from Strasbourg arrived eleven days later."
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "text": "Er war von Vater Ulrich aus dem Augustinerhause",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "It was from Father Ulrich at the Augustinian house"
    },
